```c
int i = 5;
int j = i++ * 2;
printf("%d %d", i, j);
```

*(2 marks)* What is the output of the following program?
```c
int a = 0, b = 0;
if (a++ && b++) { }
printf("%d %d", a, b);
```

*(2 marks)* What does the following program print?
```c
int f(void) { static int c = 0; return ++c; }
int main(void) { f(); f(); printf("%d", f()); return 0; }
```

